{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:44 2026-10-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:44 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:44 2026-10-21 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e0b5d2a43aa3c79838c3811287d9343d/2026-10/004_17.png\"/><p>香港海關今日（21日）在香港國際機場偵破一宗涉及航空入境旅客的販毒案件。一名20歲內地男旅客今日從土耳其伊斯坦堡飛抵本港，海關人員替他進行清關時，在其寄艙行李箱內發現約10公斤懷疑可卡因，市值約600萬元，隨即將該名男子拘捕。</p><img alt=\"檢獲的懷疑可卡因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/177780f6bd9da9bf4bc9cbb34e003137/2026-10/50D3A971D16646989AF09080D3051887_O_1_.jpeg\" title=\"檢獲的懷疑可卡因。\"/><p>檢獲的懷疑可卡因。</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T14:22:23.350815+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T13:44:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T22:38:03.239191+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:17:44.526197+00:00","content_hash":"2da8abe15c069e1987c84df8c760c4634a0e11718541f6294e6dcf81d3d350ef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}